```Title: Domain Federation or Trust Changed from the Command Line (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1484.002 | Severity: high | Sigma id: 57827ba2-b562-4423-a543-bcdbff67e700```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 1 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Identity administrators setting up federation or trusts```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity high.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
(CommandLine IN ("*Set-MsolDomainAuthentication*", "*New-MgDomainFederationConfiguration*", "*Update-MgDomainFederationConfiguration*", "*New-AADIntBackdoor*") OR (Image="*\\netdom.exe" CommandLine="*trust*" CommandLine="*/add*"))
| table _time host User ParentImage Image CommandLine
